From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juan Sanchez Fuentes <juanesf91@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 Aug 2026 10:52:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm: sun55i-a523: restore the mixer channel map

The 7000 net diff dropped the .map = {0, 6, 7, 8} from the a523 mixer
cfg. Without it sun8i_layers_init() reads an empty map and every plane
gets channel 0, so sun55i_de_layer_update() (which only stages
channel 6) skips them all - the screen shows only the RCQ background
color.

Signed-off-by: Juan Sanchez Fuentes <juanesf91@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: opencode:muse-spark-1.2-contributor-free
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_mixer.c
@@ -1040,6 +1040,7 @@
 	.mod_rate	= 600000000,
 	.ui_num		= 3,
 	.vi_num		= 1,
+	.map		= {0, 6, 7, 8},
 	.uses_rcq	= true,
 };
 
